extends base.pug

block body
  br
  div(style="max-width: 550px; padding-bottom: 20px")
    p(style='padding: 0px; margin: 0px; font-weight: 600; padding-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 20px; color: #A855F7') Welcome to ManageMate

    p(style='padding: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-bottom: 1rem; color: #6d8092; line-height: 24px;') Hi #{`${userName}`},
    p(style='padding: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-bottom: 1rem; color: #6d8092; line-height: 24px;') I'm Nessi, CEO of ManageMate, and I wanted to personally welcome you to the ManageMate family! Your decision to join us means the world to me and our entire team.
    p(style='padding: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-bottom: 1rem; color: #6d8092; line-height: 24px;') As a fellow business owner, I understand the challenges of juggling payroll, schedules, and staff management. It can feel overwhelming at times, but that's why we built ManageMate – to empower businesses like yours to thrive.
    p(style='padding: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-bottom: 1rem; color: #6d8092; line-height: 24px;') Your #{`${trialdays}`}-day free trial starts now, so dive in and explore all the features our platform offers.
    p(style='padding: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-bottom: 1rem; color: #6d8092; line-height: 24px;') We've got everything you need to power up your Shopify business, including:

    p(style='padding: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-bottom: 1rem; color: #6d8092; line-height: 24px;') ● Clock In/Out Anywhere
    p(style='padding: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-bottom: 1rem; color: #6d8092; line-height: 24px;') ● Dashboard Analytics
    p(style='padding: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-bottom: 1rem; color: #6d8092; line-height: 24px;') ● Smart Scheduling & Calendar Abilities
    p(style='padding: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-bottom: 1rem; color: #6d8092; line-height: 24px;') ● Tasks manager
    p(style='padding: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-bottom: 1rem; color: #6d8092; line-height: 24px;') ● Order Management
    p(style='padding: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-bottom: 1rem; color: #6d8092; line-height: 24px;') ● Payroll Support
    p(style='padding: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-bottom: 1rem; color: #6d8092; line-height: 24px;') ● Multi-Location Support
    p(style='padding: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-bottom: 1rem; color: #6d8092; line-height: 24px;') ● Employee Sales Attribution & Sales performance
    p(style='padding: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-bottom: 1rem; color: #6d8092; line-height: 24px;') ● Sales-based Commission plans
    p(style='padding: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-bottom: 1rem; color: #6d8092; line-height: 24px;') ● And much more!

  p(style='padding: 0px; margin: 0px; color: #212B36; line-height: 24px;') What's next?

  p(style='padding: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-bottom: 1rem; color: #6d8092; line-height: 24px;') To get started, we recommend adding your team members. Our <a style="color: #A855F7; text-decoration: none !important" href="#{tutorialsLink}">tutorials</a> are a great resource for guidance but don't just take my word for it - We have a vibrant community of ManageMate users who are eager to share their success stories and offer tips.
  p(style='padding: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-bottom: 1rem; color: #6d8092; line-height: 24px;') Don't hesitate to reach out to them or our dedicated <a style="color: #A855F7; text-decoration: none !important" href="mailto:#{serviceEmail}">support team</a> – we're here to guide you every step of the way.
  p(style='padding: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-bottom: 1rem; color: #6d8092; line-height: 24px;') I'm confident that ManageMate will become an essential part of your business, just like it has for so many others. So, let's embark on this journey together. Start your free trial today, and unlock the potential of your team with ManageMate!
  p(style='padding: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-bottom: 1rem; color: #6d8092; line-height: 24px;') Welcome aboard,
  p(style='padding: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-bottom: 1rem; color: #6d8092; line-height: 24px;') Nessi,
  p(style='padding: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-bottom: 1rem; color: #6d8092; line-height: 24px;') CEO @ ManageMate
